# source operands: $00 reads as zero (Mesa emu_get_gpr_reg_alu); writes to it are kept.
# Reading $data pops the next packet word and decrements $rem (Mesa qrisc README, "Reading
# Memory and Registers"); with (peek) (s16k) it does neither. x16 reads without the
# decrement, for the (xmov)/(sds) extra reads, which count $rem themselves.
# $memdata and $regdata are the memory/register read queues: volatile reads.
